how to write a company profile marketing  is hard okay for a lot of entrepreneurs  marketing is one of the hardest things  that they have to do you might be great  at your product your service talking to  customers once they've bought service in  them making them feel happy going going  over and above to exceed their  expectations you're probably really good  at that but marketing is something that  a lot of you are really bad at and and  marketing is hard look at the marketing  around you look at look at marketing  from from entrepreneurs small businesses  all the way up to big companies how many  marketing campaigns do you remember how  many of them leave a lasting mark on you  think about the TV that you just watched  whatever show you watched last night all  the commercials that you saw how many of  you actually remember probably not a lot  because the marketing is not memorable  and that's from big business all the way  down to you as an entrepreneur and you  have an opportunity to stand out and  that comes with your company profile  that's a starting point people want to  know what you do to me marketing is all  about values people want to know what  you stand for they want to know why they  should care make me care quickly because  I'm only watching you for two seconds  and then I'm off to somewhere else so  make me care give me a reason to care  make it personal  whatever business you're in you have to  be about something more important you  have to let that shine through if you  look at Nike they're not selling shoes  shoes are a commodity item you could  sell shoes and buy them off of ebay for  cheap you can you can get them sourced  in China crappy shoes it doesn't matter  you're not they're not selling shoes  what Nike does is they honor athletics  they honor great athletes that's what  you're buying into when you buy a Nike  shoe you feel like you're LeBron James  that's what you're buying into so what  are people buying into when they connect  with you how can they feel that right  away tell me your story you have an  advantage as an entrepreneur  to tell me your story to make it  personal to make it passionate tell me  why you started this company what you  believe in because if you make a boring  company profile like everybody else it's  going to get ignored when was the last  time you saw an exciting memorable  company profile if you're selling lawn  care services you don't want to just say  ABC company we sell ferns and lawns  landscaping and grass cutting and all  the boring stuff snow removal blah blah  blah you just lost me I'm moving on to  somebody else show your picture show  your smiling face or even a video would  be better but if you're shy at least a  picture say hi I'm John I started this  business because I love landscaping I  will care for a year in lawn like it's  my own I got into this because you know  you tell whatever story when you were  five years old your mom gave you a  flower and that reminds you of her all  the time like make it personal touch me  with something make me feel like I want  to know you I want you working on my  lawn that can come through in your  company profile if you make it a  standard boring one you might as well  not have a company profile at all  because people are going to gloss over  it this comes as a result from a  question from Mark who wrote in for my  newsletter list  he said I'm starting a company it's in  real estate and I'm looking forward to  your assistance on making a company  profile listen so you're in real estate  okay hugely competitive field how many  people are in real estate  tons of people it's hard to stand out  but most people do such a bad job nobody  tells a personal story nobody's an  expert at something tell me why you got  into real estate who says that who says  why they got into real estate who has a  personal story that I can connect with  nobody this is your chance  get in there tell me why you love real  estate tell me how you pour yourself  into this business show me some passion  so that when I'm looking for somebody to  work with on real estate I'm going to  pick you over everybody else because you  made a personal connection with me show  me your face  tell me your story tell me how you got  started make me care make me care  because most company profiles don't make  me care they're boring they're useless  keep it simple keep it short you could  do it in a hundred words and make me  feel something you do that you're ahead  of the game I don't know why more people  don't do this we look at we look at the  examples that are out there and we say  oh well this guy is they're not like  that so I'm going to copy him and just  modify it but he's not having success  with his either take the opportunity to  connect with people show your face tell  me about your passion and make me care  that's a winning company profile that's  going to get you some business belief  for those you watching liked the video  please give it a thumbs up below I love  doing these videos for you and your  comments your feedback make me want to  keep going so thank you leave a question  underneath I'll make a video response  thank you so much and I'll see you soon
 

